    "projectNameAr": "استغلال الطاقة الحرارية المفقودة",
    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>The project includes the construction of a waste heat recovery unit (WHR) to transform the plant&#39;s waste heat into electricity, thereby conserving energy and cutting emissions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The unit is set to be operational before end of 2016.</p>\r\n",
